{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"OnlineManager"},{"type":"text","value":" manages the online state within TanStack Query."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"It can be used to change the default event listeners or to manually change the online state."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Its available methods are:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"#onlinemanagerseteventlistener","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"setEventListener"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"#onlinemanagersetonline","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"setOnline"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"#onlinemanagerisonline","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"isOnline"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"onlinemanager-seteventlistener","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onlineManager.setEventListener"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"setEventListener"},{"type":"text","value":" can be used to set a custom event listener:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import NetInfo from '@react-native-community/netinfo'\nimport { onlineManager } from '@tanstack/react-query'\n\nonlineManager.setEventListener(setOnline => {\n  return NetInfo.addEventListener(state => {\n    setOnline(!!state.isConnected)\n  })\n})","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"onlinemanager-setonline","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onlineManager.setOnline"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"setOnline"},{"type":"text","value":" can be used to manually set the online state. Set "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"undefined"},{"type":"text","value":" to fallback to the default online check."}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { onlineManager } from '@tanstack/react-query'\n\n// Set to online\nonlineManager.setOnline(true)\n\n// Set to offline\nonlineManager.setOnline(false)\n\n// Fallback to the default online check\nonlineManager.setOnline(undefined)","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Options"}]}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"online: boolean | undefined"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"onlinemanager-isonline","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onlineManager.isOnline"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"isOnline"},{"type":"text","value":" can be used to get the current online state."}]},{"type":"code","value":"const isOnline = onlineManager.isOnline()","lang":"tsx"}],"headings":[{"id":"onlinemanager-seteventlistener","text":"onlineManager.setEventListener","level":2},{"id":"onlinemanager-setonline","text":"onlineManager.setOnline","level":2},{"id":"onlinemanager-isonline","text":"onlineManager.isOnline","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThe `OnlineManager` manages the online state within TanStack Query.\n\nIt can be used to change the default event listeners or to manually change the online state.\n\nIts available methods are:\n\n- [`setEventListener`](#onlinemanagerseteventlistener)\n- [`setOnline`](#onlinemanagersetonline)\n- [`isOnline`](#onlinemanagerisonline)\n\n## `onlineManager.setEventListener`\n\n`setEventListener` can be used to set a custom event listener:\n\n```tsx\nimport NetInfo from '@react-native-community/netinfo'\nimport { onlineManager } from '@tanstack/react-query'\n\nonlineManager.setEventListener(setOnline => {\n  return NetInfo.addEventListener(state => {\n    setOnline(!!state.isConnected)\n  })\n})\n```\n\n## `onlineManager.setOnline`\n\n`setOnline` can be used to manually set the online state. Set `undefined` to fallback to the default online check.\n\n```tsx\nimport { onlineManager } from '@tanstack/react-query'\n\n// Set to online\nonlineManager.setOnline(true)\n\n// Set to offline\nonlineManager.setOnline(false)\n\n// Fallback to the default online check\nonlineManager.setOnline(undefined)\n```\n\n**Options**\n\n- `online: boolean | undefined`\n\n## `onlineManager.isOnline`\n\n`isOnline` can be used to get the current online state.\n\n```tsx\nconst isOnline = onlineManager.isOnline()\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: OnlineManager\ntitle: OnlineManager\n---\n\nThe `OnlineManager` manages the online state within TanStack Query.\n\nIt can be used to change the default event listeners or to manually change the online state.\n\nIts available methods are:\n\n- [`setEventListener`](#onlinemanagerseteventlistener)\n- [`setOnline`](#onlinemanagersetonline)\n- [`isOnline`](#onlinemanagerisonline)\n\n## `onlineManager.setEventListener`\n\n`setEventListener` can be used to set a custom event listener:\n\n```tsx\nimport NetInfo from '@react-native-community/netinfo'\nimport { onlineManager } from '@tanstack/react-query'\n\nonlineManager.setEventListener(setOnline => {\n  return NetInfo.addEventListener(state => {\n    setOnline(!!state.isConnected)\n  })\n})\n```\n\n## `onlineManager.setOnline`\n\n`setOnline` can be used to manually set the online state. Set `undefined` to fallback to the default online check.\n\n```tsx\nimport { onlineManager } from '@tanstack/react-query'\n\n// Set to online\nonlineManager.setOnline(true)\n\n// Set to offline\nonlineManager.setOnline(false)\n\n// Fallback to the default online check\nonlineManager.setOnline(undefined)\n```\n\n**Options**\n\n- `online: boolean | undefined`\n\n## `onlineManager.isOnline`\n\n`isOnline` can be used to get the current online state.\n\n```tsx\nconst isOnline = onlineManager.isOnline()\n```\n"}
